---
title: Tomato Bacon Bit Sandwich
servings: 1
tags: vegan, sandwich, lunch, no-cook, bacon, plant-based
source: https://shakaylafelice.substack.com/p/tomato-sandwich-with-a-tofu-bacon
---

== Create the Aioli ==

In a bowl, combine @./Tofu Bacon Bits{1/4%cup}, @mayo{1/3%cup}, @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, @salt{}, @soy sauce{splash} and @black pepper{} to taste. Mix until well combined. Set aside.

== Assemble the Sandwich ==

Cut @sourdough bread{2%slices}(thick slices — thick slices are KEY! Try grabbing it from a local café, bakery, or farmers market) into thick slices and toast either on the #stove, in the #oven, or in a #toaster oven.

Slice @heirloom tomatoes{1-2} and season with @salt{} and @black pepper{} to taste.

Add a layer of the tofu bacon aioli to both pieces of bread. To one slice, add the sliced and seasoned tomatoes. Top with @micro greens{1/3%cup} and salt and pepper to taste.

> This aioli is fully customizable! Use however much of each ingredient you'd like.